{
 "$comment": "Fixture for ConformanceProbe in every host glue (TS, Swift, Kotlin, C++): feed `messages` (host → renderer JSON, as Renderer.send receives them) through the probe; it must report `updates` results, the last equal to `final`, the html element id `htmlId`. Typed-op hosts (Swift acceptsTypedOps) feed the same batches as WidgetOp. See CLIENTS.md, \"Reading the ops\".",
